{
  "$comment": [
    "GROUND TRUTH for the grid-landscape survey.",
    "",
    "scripts/check-grid-research.mjs recomputes coverage from this file and",
    "refuses a partial answer in BOTH directions: every id here must have a",
    "section in docs/research/grid-landscape.md, and every section in that doc",
    "must have an id here. A count-only gate would pass fabrications, so the",
    "verifier also requires each section to fill every required field with",
    "something other than a placeholder, and to cite at least one source URL.",
    "",
    "PROVENANCE POLICY (inherited from packages/migrate/src/transforms/ag-grid.ts):",
    "findings come from publicly-published documentation, marketing pages and",
    "public repositories only. No third-party source code is copied and no",
    "non-public docs are consulted. Where a capability is not documented, the",
    "correct answer is 'not documented' with the URL that was checked — never a",
    "guess.",
    "",
    "SCOPE BOUNDARY — deliberately excluded, recorded so it is not re-litigated:",
    "pure virtualization primitives with no grid semantics (react-window,",
    "react-virtual, TanStack Virtual); charting libraries with an incidental",
    "table view; and BI/dashboard products where the grid is not a component a",
    "developer can embed (Tableau, PowerBI, Looker)."
  ],
  "requiredField": [
    "license",
    "rendering",
    "virtualization",
    "nesting",
    "charting",
    "formula",
    "pivot",
    "editing",
    "framework",
    "dataModel",
    "distinctive"
  ],
